{"sha": "a06420cc6a28d8dd91299b472245344b3dd52ce2bbffae12b98138a265ff61b3", "body": ["\\begin{definition}[辐角、三角形式与指数形式]\\label{def:g12:complex:argument}", "设 $z \\neq 0$。$z$ 的\\emph{辐角}\\index{辐角}，记作", "$\\Arg(z)$，是任一度量 $\\theta$，它表示从正实轴到射线 $OM$ 所成的角；", "它在相差 $2k\\pi$ 的意义下确定。记 $r = \\abs z$，", "\\[", "z = r(\\cos\\theta + \\iu\\sin\\theta)", "\\qquad\\text{（三角形式）}.", "\\]", "引入记号\\index{指数形式}", "\\[", "\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} = \\cos\\theta + \\iu\\sin\\theta,", "\\]", "于是得到\\emph{指数形式} $z = r\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.5]", "  \\draw[->] (-0.7,0) -- (2.4,0) node[right] {$x$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,-0.5) -- (0,1.9) node[above] {$y$};", "  \\draw[gray, dashed] (1.9,0) arc (0:75:1.9);", "  \\draw[-Stealth,omDef,thick] (0,0) -- (40:1.9)", "    node[pos=0.62, below right=1pt, font=\\small] {$r = \\abs z$};", "  \\fill (40:1.9) circle (1pt) node[above right] {$z = r\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$};", "  \\draw[->,omThm,thick] (0.45,0) arc (0:40:0.45);", "  \\node[omThm] at (20:0.65) {$\\theta$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 指数形式：$z$ 由它到原点的距离 $r$ 与", "从正实轴量起的角 $\\theta$ 唯一确定。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{theorem}\\label{thm:g12:complex:expform}", "对所有 $\\theta, \\theta' \\in \\R$：", "\\[", "\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\theta'} = \\eu^{\\iu(\\theta + \\theta')},", "\\qquad", "\\conj{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}} = \\eu^{-\\iu\\theta},", "\\qquad", "\\abs{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}} = 1 .", "\\]", "由此，对非零的 $z = r\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$ 与", "$z' = r'\\eu^{\\iu\\theta'}$，有：", "\\[", "zz' = rr'\\,\\eu^{\\iu(\\theta+\\theta')},", "\\qquad", "\\frac{z}{z'} = \\frac{r}{r'}\\,\\eu^{\\iu(\\theta - \\theta')} :", "\\]", "\\emph{模相乘，辐角相加。}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "第一个恒等式\\emph{即是}两个加法公式", "（\\cref{prop:g12:trigo:addition}）：", "\\[", "(\\cos\\theta + \\iu\\sin\\theta)(\\cos\\theta' + \\iu\\sin\\theta')", "= (\\cos\\theta\\cos\\theta' - \\sin\\theta\\sin\\theta')", "+ \\iu(\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta' + \\cos\\theta\\sin\\theta').", "\\]", "其余部分由直接计算可得。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{corollary}[棣莫弗公式]\\label{cor:g12:complex:demoivre}", "\\index{棣莫弗公式}", "对 $\\theta \\in \\R$ 与 $n \\in \\Z$，有", "$\\bigl(\\cos\\theta + \\iu\\sin\\theta\\bigr)^n = \\cos n\\theta + \\iu \\sin n\\theta$。", "\\end{corollary}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对 $n \\geq 0$ 用数学归纳法，并利用\\cref{thm:g12:complex:expform}；", "再通过取逆，将结论推广到 $n < 0$ 的情形。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[两种形式之间的互化]\\label{met:g12:complex:forms}", "由代数形式化为指数形式：计算 $r = \\abs z$，再求角 $\\theta$，使", "$\\cos\\theta = \\frac ar$，$\\sin\\theta = \\frac br$（使用反余弦前，", "须先定出正确的象限）。由指数形式化为代数形式：展开", "$r\\cos\\theta + \\iu\\, r\\sin\\theta$。求和用代数形式，", "乘积、幂与商用指数形式。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}", "取 $z = 1 + \\iu$，则 $\\abs z = \\sqrt2$，且 $\\cos\\theta = \\sin\\theta =", "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}$，故 $\\theta = \\frac\\pi4$，且 $z = \\sqrt2\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/4}$。", "因此 $z^{20} = 2^{10}\\,\\eu^{5\\iu\\pi} = -1024$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{二次方程与单位根}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[实系数二次方程]\\label{thm:g12:complex:quadratic}", "设 $a, b, c \\in \\R$，$a \\neq 0$，$\\Delta = b^2 - 4ac$。方程", "$az^2 + bz + c = 0$ 在 $\\C$ 中的解为：", "\\[", "\\begin{aligned}", "&\\Delta > 0:\\ z = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{\\Delta}}{2a} \\ (\\text{两个实根}); \\qquad", "\\Delta = 0:\\ z = \\frac{-b}{2a} \\ (\\text{二重根}); \\\\", "&\\Delta < 0:\\ z = \\frac{-b \\pm \\iu\\sqrt{-\\Delta}}{2a} \\ (\\text{两个共轭复根}).", "\\end{aligned}", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "配方：", "$az^2 + bz + c = a\\left(\\left(z + \\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2 -", "\\frac{\\Delta}{4a^2}\\right)$。若 $\\Delta < 0$，则", "$\\frac{\\Delta}{4a^2} = \\left(\\iu\\frac{\\sqrt{-\\Delta}}{2a}\\right)^2$，于是", "由平方差公式照常分解。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[单位根]\\label{def:g12:complex:rootsofunity}", "对 $n \\geq 1$，\\emph{$n$ 次单位根}\\index{单位根}是", "方程 $z^n = 1$ 的解。", "\\end{definition}", ""]}